 Who Wins the Customer\", \"description\": \"Lead response time decides who wins the customer. See the speed-to-lead research, why businesses stay slow, and five moves to reply to every lead in minutes.\", \"image\": {\"@type\": \"ImageObject\", \"url\": \"https://statics.pancake.vn/web-media-264/71/d2/32/1e/4554a9d54070ab0b9df1705468da226d672f0fbce55412695d7b1582.png\", \"width\": 1536, \"height\": 864, \"caption\": \"Isometric illustration of a stopwatch beside a conveyor of message tiles moving into a teal inbox, with one orange message arriving first and a dashboard showing a falling line\"}, \"datePublished\": \"2026-11-05\", \"dateModified\": \"2026-11-05\", \"inLanguage\": \"en\", \"wordCount\": 1708, \"articleSection\": \"CRM and automation that sells\", \"keywords\": \"lead response time, speed to lead, lead response study, respond to leads fast, instant lead reply, AI lead response, Dijae Dadula\", \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home#person\", \"name\": \"Dijae Dadula\", \"url\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home\"}, \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home#person\", \"name\": \"Dijae Dadula\"}, \"isPartOf\": {\"@type\": \"Blog\", \"@id\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/blog#blog\", \"url\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/blog\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"@id\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/lead-response-time#faq\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is a good lead response time?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Aim for an automatic, useful reply within seconds and human contact with qualified leads within five minutes to one hour. Research found that the odds of contacting and qualifying a lead fall sharply after the first five minutes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What does speed to lead mean?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Speed to lead is the time between a lead reaching out (a form, a message, a call) and your business responding. It is usually measured as time to first reply and time to first human contact.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How fast do most businesses respond to leads?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Slowly. A 2011 study of 2,241 US companies found an average response time of 42 hours, and a 2026 test of 114 B2B companies found an average email reply time of almost 12 hours.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can AI reply to leads instantly?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. An AI chatbot or voice agent can reply in seconds on chat channels and the phone, answer common questions and book appointments. Keep a person responsible for qualified leads, and route them quickly.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Blog\", \"item\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/blog\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Lead Response Time\", \"item\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/lead-response-time\"}]}</script><meta property='og:type' content='article'><meta property='og:site_name' content='Dijae Dadula'><meta property='og:url' content='https://www.dijaedadula.com/lead-response-time'><meta property='og:title' content='Lead Response Time: Why the First Five Minutes Decide Who Wins the Customer'><meta property='og:description' content='Lead response time decides who wins the customer. See the speed-to-lead research, why businesses stay slow, and five moves to reply to every lead in minutes.'><meta property='og:image' content='https://statics.pancake.vn/web-media-264/71/d2/32/1e/4554a9d54070ab0b9df1